---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="AI-Based Career Guide">
  <div class="shell page">
    <div class="kicker">// PROJECT 01 · CAPSTONE 2026</div>
    <h1>AI-Based Career Guide.</h1>
    <p class="page-intro">A Computer Science capstone prototype that brings career exploration, skill-gap analysis, resume workflows, learning paths and AI-assisted interview practice into one platform.</p>
    <div class="button-row" style="margin: 18px 0 28px">
      <a class="button primary" href="https://github.com/Ezra2121-et/career-guide-ai" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">View source on GitHub ↗</a>
      <a class="button" href="https://career-guide-ai-nine.vercel.app" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Open project URL ↗</a>
    </div>
    <div class="article"><div class="prose">
      <h2>What it covers</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Career and job exploration, including job-specific skill analysis.</li>
        <li>Resume workflows and resume optimization endpoints.</li>
        <li>Learning paths and resources for closing skill gaps.</li>
        <li>AI-assisted interview practice with saved interview sessions and feedback.</li>
        <li>User onboarding, profiles and authenticated application areas.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Technology</h2>
      <div class="tags"><span class="tag">Next.js</span><span class="tag">TypeScript</span><span class="tag">PostgreSQL</span><span class="tag">Prisma</span><span class="tag">Google Generative AI</span><span class="tag">Better Auth</span></div>
      <h2>Status</h2>
      <p>This is presented as a prototype, not as a production career-advice service. The source repository is the most reliable place to inspect the implementation and its current setup requirements.</p>
    </div></div>
  </div>
</Base>
